{%- comment -%}
  Structured Data (JSON-LD) for Google Rich Snippets & AI SEO (GEO / Generative Engine Optimization)
  Includes: Organization (Entity Graph), WebSite, Breadcrumbs (Collections, Products, Articles, Blogs),
  Product (with Material, Color, Audience, Shipping to DE & EU, Return Policy),
  CollectionPage, and BlogPosting (for conversational AI citations).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign origin_url = shop.url -%}
{%- assign price_valid_until = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 31536000 | date: '%Y-%m-%d' -%}

